This project is an original TypeScript and Next.js implementation inspired by
FinanceHarness: Autonomous Financial Deep Research Framework by Yijia Xiao,
Rujun Han, Yanfei Chen, Zifeng Wang, Ke Jiang, Zhongying CuiZhu, Vishy
Tirumalashetty, Wei Wang, Burak Gokturk, Tomas Pfister, and Chen-Yu Lee.

Upstream project: https://github.com/Yijia-Xiao/FinanceHarness
Paper: https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.27853

FinanceHarness is distributed under the Apache License 2.0. No upstream source
files are copied into this implementation. The architecture, interfaces, and
product UI in Underwrite are implemented independently in TypeScript.

